From 3211f16a5d4dc1b3d7c772fba6d6ae10546c8e27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bruno Haible <bruno@clisp.org>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:40:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Make it possible to load the ANSI tests in CLISP.

* */load.lsp, */*/load.lsp: List the file names explicitly. Remove unportable
assumptions about how LOAD uses *DEFAULT-PATHNAME-DEFAULTS* and about the
absence of a :HOST and a :DEVICE component in pathnames.
